hoice</a></td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1\">Value Set: <a href=\"ValueSet-ahip-outreach-mode.html\">AHIP Outreach Modes</a></td></tr>#xD;\n<tr class=\"xhtRowBorder1 xhtRowOdd\"><td style=\"background-image: url(tbl_bck11.png)\" id=\"item.SOGIARS\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1 xhtCellNoWrap\"><img src=\"tbl_spacer.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"tbl_vjoin.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"icon-q-group.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: #F7F7F7; background-color: inherit\" title=\"group\" class=\"hierarchy\"/> <span style=\"position: absolute; width: 1px; height: 1px; padding: 0; margin: -1px; overflow: hidden; clip: rect(0, 0, 0, 0); white-space: nowrap; border: 0\" class=\"sr-only\">AHIP-DEMOGRAPHIC-QUESTIONNAIRE / </span>SOGIARS</td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1\">SOGI and Relationship Status Section</td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1\">1..1</td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1\"><a href=\"https://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-item-type.html#item-type-group\">group</a></td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1\"/></tr>#xD;\n<tr class=\"xhtRowBorder1 xhtRowEven\"><td style=\"background-image: url(tbl_bck110.png)\" id=\"item.SOGIARS-3.1\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1 xhtCellNoWrap\"><img src=\"tbl_spacer.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"tbl_vline.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"tbl_vjoin.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"icon-q-coding.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: white; background-color: inherit\" title=\"coding\" class=\"hierarchy\"/> <span style=\"position: absolute; width: 1px; height: 1px; padding: 0; margin: -1px; overflow: hidden; clip: rect(0, 0, 0, 0); white-space: nowrap; border: 0\" class=\"sr-only\">AHIP-DEMOGRAPHIC-QUESTIONNAIRE / SOGIARS / </span>SOGIARS-3.1</td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1\">Sexual Orientation- At this time, do you think of yourself as (select one):​</td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1\">1..1</td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1\"><a href=\"https://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-item-type.html#item-type-open-choice\">open-choice</a></td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1\">Value Set: <a href=\"ValueSet-ahip-sexual-orientation.html\">AHIP Sexual Orientation</a></td></tr>#xD;\n<tr class=\"xhtRowBorder1 xhtRowOdd\"><td style=\"background-image: url(tbl_bck110.png)\" id=\"item.SOGIARS-3.2\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1 xhtCellNoWrap\"><img src=\"tbl_spacer.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"tbl_vline.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"tbl_vjoin.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"icon-q-coding.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: #F7F7F7; background-color: inherit\" title=\"coding\" class=\"hierarchy\"/> <span style=\"position: absolute; width: 1px; height: 1px; padding: 0; margin: -1px; overflow: hidden; clip: rect(0, 0, 0, 0); white-space: nowrap; border: 0\" class=\"sr-only\">AHIP-DEMOGRAPHIC-QUESTIONNAIRE / SOGIARS / </span>SOGIARS-3.2</td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1\">What sex were you assigned at birth on your original birth certificate? (Sex assigned at birth is the sex (male, female or intersex) that a doctor or midwife uses to describe a child at birth based on their external body parts.) Select one.​</td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1\">1..1</td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1\"><a href=\"https://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-item-type.html#item-type-choice\">choice</a></td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1\">Value Set: <a href=\"ValueSet-ahip-birth-sex.html\">AHIP Birth Sex</a></td></tr>#xD;\n<tr class=\"xhtRowBorder1 xhtRowEven\"><td style=\"background-image: url(tbl_bck110.png)\" id=\"item.SOGIARS-3.3\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1 xhtCellNoWrap\"><img src=\"tbl_spacer.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"tbl_vline.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"tbl_vjoin.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"icon-q-coding.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: white; background-color: inherit\" title=\"coding\" class=\"hierarchy\"/> <span style=\"position: absolute; width: 1px; height: 1px; padding: 0; margin: -1px; overflow: hidden; clip: rect(0, 0, 0, 0); white-space: nowrap; border: 0\" class=\"sr-only\">AHIP-DEMOGRAPHIC-QUESTIONNAIRE / SOGIARS / </span>SOGIARS-3.3</td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1\">What is your gender? (Select one)</td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1\">1..1</td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1\"><a href=\"https://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-item-type.html#item-type-open-choice\">open-choice</a></td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1\">Value Set: <a href=\"ValueSet-ahip-demo-gender-identity.html\">AHIP Gender Identity</a></td></tr>#xD;\n<tr class=\"xhtRowBorder1 xhtRowOdd\"><td style=\"background-image: url(tbl_bck110.png)\" id=\"item.SOGIARS-3.4\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1 xhtCellNoWrap\"><img src=\"tbl_spacer.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"tbl_vline.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"tbl_vjoin.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"icon-q-coding.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: #F7F7F7; background-color: inherit\" title=\"coding\" class=\"hierarchy\"/> <span style=\"position: absolute; width: 1px; height: 1px; padding: 0; margin: -1px; overflow: hidden; clip: rect(0, 0, 0, 0); white-space: nowrap; border: 0\" class=\"sr-only\">AHIP-DEMOGRAPHIC-QUESTIONNAIRE / SOGIARS / </span>SOGIARS-3.4</td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1\">Preferred Pronouns - Optional: We would like to be respectful. What pronouns do you use to identify yourself? Select all that apply.​</td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1\">0..*</td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1\"><a href=\"https://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-item-type.html#item-type-open-choice\">open-choice</a></td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1\">Value Set: <a href=\"ValueSet-ahip-preferred-pronouns.html\">AHIP Preferred Pronouns</a></td></tr>#xD;\n<tr class=\"xhtRowBorder1 xhtRowEven\"><td style=\"background-image: url(tbl_bck100.png)\" id=\"item.SOGIARS-3.5\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1 xhtCellNoWrap\"><img src=\"tbl_spacer.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"tbl_vline.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"tbl_vjoin_end.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"icon-q-coding.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: white; background-color: inherit\" title=\"coding\" class=\"hierarchy\"/> <span style=\"position: absolute; width: 1px; height: 1px; padding: 0; margin: -1px; overflow: hidden; clip: rect(0, 0, 0, 0); white-space: nowrap; border: 0\" class=\"sr-only\">AHIP-DEMOGRAPHIC-QUESTIONNAIRE / SOGIARS / </span>SOGIARS-3.5</td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1\">Optional: What is your relationship status? (Select all that apply)​</td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1\">0..*</td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1\"><a href=\"https://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-item-type.html#item-type-open-choice\">open-choice</a></td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1\">Value Set: <a href=\"ValueSet-ahip-relationship-status.html\">AHIP Relationship Status</a></td></t