f the following? Check all that apply.​</td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1\">0..*</td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1\"><a href=\"https://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-item-type.html#item-type-open-choice\">open-choice</a></td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1\">Value Set: <a href=\"ValueSet-ahip-disability.html\">AHIP Disability</a></td></tr>#xD;\n<tr class=\"xhtRowBorder1 xhtRowOdd\"><td style=\"background-image: url(tbl_bck11.png)\" id=\"item.MS\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1 xhtCellNoWrap\"><img src=\"tbl_spacer.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"tbl_vjoin.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"icon-q-group.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: #F7F7F7; background-color: inherit\" title=\"group\" class=\"hierarchy\"/> <span style=\"position: absolute; width: 1px; height: 1px; padding: 0; margin: -1px; overflow: hidden; clip: rect(0, 0, 0, 0); white-space: nowrap; border: 0\" class=\"sr-only\">AHIP-DEMOGRAPHIC-QUESTIONNAIRE / </span>MS</td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1\">Military Service Section</td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1\">1..1</td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1\"><a href=\"https://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-item-type.html#item-type-group\">group</a></td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1\"/></tr>#xD;\n<tr class=\"xhtRowBorder1 xhtRowEven\"><td style=\"background-image: url(tbl_bck110.png)\" id=\"item.MS-5.1\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1 xhtCellNoWrap\"><img src=\"tbl_spacer.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"tbl_vline.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"tbl_vjoin.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"icon-q-coding.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: white; background-color: inherit\" title=\"coding\" class=\"hierarchy\"/> <span style=\"position: absolute; width: 1px; height: 1px; padding: 0; margin: -1px; overflow: hidden; clip: rect(0, 0, 0, 0); white-space: nowrap; border: 0\" class=\"sr-only\">AHIP-DEMOGRAPHIC-QUESTIONNAIRE / MS / </span>MS-5.1</td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1\">Have you ever served in the United States Armed Forces, military Reserves, or National Guard? Select one.</td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1\">1..1</td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1\"><a href=\"https://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-item-type.html#item-type-choice\">choice</a></td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1\">Value Set: <a href=\"ValueSet-ahip-yes-no-dont-know-no-response.html\">AHIP Yes, No, Don't Know, or No Response</a></td></tr>#xD;\n<tr class=\"xhtRowBorder1 xhtRowOdd\"><td style=\"background-image: url(tbl_bck110.png)\" id=\"item.MS-5.2\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1 xhtCellNoWrap\"><img src=\"tbl_spacer.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"tbl_vline.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"tbl_vjoin.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"icon-q-coding.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: #F7F7F7; background-color: inherit\" title=\"coding\" class=\"hierarchy\"/> <span style=\"position: absolute; width: 1px; height: 1px; padding: 0; margin: -1px; overflow: hidden; clip: rect(0, 0, 0, 0); white-space: nowrap; border: 0\" class=\"sr-only\">AHIP-DEMOGRAPHIC-QUESTIONNAIRE / MS / </span>MS-5.2</td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1\">When did you serve? Check an option for EACH period in which you served, even if just for part of the period.)​</td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1\">0..*</td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1\"><a href=\"https://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-item-type.html#item-type-choice\">choice</a></td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1\">Enable When: <span><a href=\"#item.MS-5.1\">MS-5.1</a> = Yes (LOINC#LA33-6)</span><br/>Value Set: <a href=\"ValueSet-ahip-military-service-period.html\">AHIP US Military Service Period Codes</a></td></tr>#xD;\n<tr class=\"xhtRowBorder1 xhtRowEven\"><td style=\"background-image: url(tbl_bck110.png)\" id=\"item.MS-5.3\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1 xhtCellNoWrap\"><img src=\"tbl_spacer.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"tbl_vline.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"tbl_vjoin.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"icon-q-string.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: white; background-color: inherit\" title=\"string\" class=\"hierarchy\"/> <span style=\"position: absolute; width: 1px; height: 1px; padding: 0; margin: -1px; overflow: hidden; clip: rect(0, 0, 0, 0); white-space: nowrap; border: 0\" class=\"sr-only\">AHIP-DEMOGRAPHIC-QUESTIONNAIRE / MS / </span>MS-5.3</td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1\">Where did you serve?</td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1\">0..*</td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1\"><a href=\"https://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-item-type.html#item-type-string\">string</a></td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1\">Enable When: <span><a href=\"#item.MS-5.1\">MS-5.1</a> = Yes (LOINC#LA33-6)</span></td></tr>#xD;\n<tr class=\"xhtRowBorder1 xhtRowOdd\"><td style=\"background-image: url(tbl_bck110.png)\" id=\"item.MS-5.4\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1 xhtCellNoWrap\"><img src=\"tbl_spacer.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"tbl_vline.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"tbl_vjoin.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"icon-q-coding.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: #F7F7F7; background-color: inherit\" title=\"coding\" class=\"hierarchy\"/> <span style=\"position: absolute; width: 1px; height: 1px; padding: 0; margin: -1px; overflow: hidden; clip: rect(0, 0, 0, 0); white-space: nowrap; border: 0\" class=\"sr-only\">AHIP-DEMOGRAPHIC-QUESTIONNAIRE / MS / </span>MS-5.4</td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1\">Did an immediate family member who you live or lived with ever serve in the United States Armed Forces, military Reserves, or National Guard? (i.e., parent, guardian, spouse, partner, child, sibling etc.) Select one.​</td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1\">0..1</td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1\"><a href=\"https://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-item-type.html#item-type-choice\">choice</a></td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1\">Value Set: <a href=\"ValueSet-ahip-yes-no-dont-know-no-response.html\">AHIP Yes, No, Don't Know, or No Response</a></td></tr>#xD;\n<tr class=\"xhtRowBorder1 xhtRowEven\"><td style=\"background-image: url(tbl_bck101.png)\" id=\"item.MS-5.5\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1 xhtCellNoWrap\"><img src=\"tbl_spacer.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"tbl_vline.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"tbl_vjoin_end.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"icon-q-group.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: white; background-color: inherit\" title=\"group\" class=\"hierarchy\"/> <span style=\"position: absolute; width: 1px; height: 1px; padding: 0; margin: -1px; overflow: hidden; clip: rect(0, 0, 0, 0); white-space: nowrap; border: 0\" class=\"sr-only\">AHIP-DEMOGRAPHIC-QUESTIONNAIRE / MS / </span>MS-5.5</td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1\">Other Military Service</td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1\">0..*</td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1\"><a href=\"https://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-item-type.html#item-type-group\">group</a></td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1\"/></tr>#xD;\n<tr class=\"xhtRowBorder1 xhtRowOdd\"><td style=\"background-image: url(tbl_bck1010.png)\" id=\"item.MS-5.5.1\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1 xhtCellNoWrap\"><img src=\"tbl_spacer.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"tbl_vline.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"tbl_blank.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"tbl_vjoin.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"icon-q-coding.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: #F7F7F7; background-color: inherit\" title=\"coding\" class=\"hierarchy\"/> <span style=\"position: absolute; width: 1px; height: 1px; padding: 0; margin: -1px; overflow: hidden; clip: rect(0, 0, 0, 0); white-space: nowrap; border: 0\" class=\"sr-only\">AHIP-DEMOGRAPHIC-QUESTIONNAIRE / MS / MS-5.5 / </span>MS-5.5.1</td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1\">Are you serving or have you ever served in the armed forces of a country other than the United States? (Select one)​</td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1\">0..1</td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1\"><a href=\"https://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-item-type.html#item-type-choice\">choice</a></td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1\">Value Set: <a href=\"ValueSet-ahip-yes-no-dont-know-no-response.html\">AHIP Yes, No, Don't Know, or No Response</a></td></tr>#xD;\n<tr class=\"xhtRowBorder1 xhtRowEven\"><td style=\"background-image: url(tbl_bck1010.png)\" id=\"item.MS-5.5.2\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1 xhtCellNoWrap\"><img src=\"tbl_spacer.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"tbl_vline.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"tbl_blank.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"tbl_vjoin.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"icon-q-string.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: white; background-color: inherit\" title=\"string\" class=\"hierarchy\"/> <span style=\"position: absolute; width: 1px; height: 1px; padding: 0; margin: -1px; overflow: hidden; clip: rect(0, 0, 0, 0); white-space: nowrap; border: 0\" class=\"sr-only\">AHIP-DEMOGRAPHIC-QUESTIONNAIRE / MS / MS-5.5 / </span>MS-5.5.2</td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1\">When did you serve? Enter the period(s) in which you served.</td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1\">0..*</td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1\"><a href=\"https://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-item-type.html#item-type-string\">string</a></td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1\">Enable When: <span><a href=\"#item.MS-5.5.1\">MS-5.5.1</a> = Yes (LOINC#LA33-6)</span></td></tr>#xD;\n<tr class=\"xhtRowBorder1 xhtRowOdd\"><td style=\"background-image: url(tbl_bck1010.png)\" id=\"item.MS-5.5.3\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1 xhtCellNoWrap\"><img src=\"tbl_spacer.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"tbl_vline.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"tbl_blank.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"tbl_vjoin.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"icon-q-string.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: #F7F7F7; background-color: inherit\" title=\"string\" class=\"hierarchy\"/> <span style=\"position: absolute; width: 1px; height: 1px; padding: 0; margin: -1px; overflow: hidden; clip: rect(0, 0, 0, 0); white-space: nowrap; border: 0\" class=\"sr-only\">AHIP-DEMOGRAPHIC-QUESTIONNAIRE / MS / MS-5.5 / </span>MS-5.5.3</td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1\">Where did you serve?</td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1\">0..*</td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1\"><a href=\"https://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-item-type.html#item-type-string\">string</a></td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1\">Enable When: <span><a href=\"#item.MS-5.5.1\">MS-5.5.1</a> = Yes (LOINC#LA33-6)</span></td></tr>#xD;\n<tr class=\"xhtRowBorder1 xhtRowEven\"><td style=\"background-image: url(tbl_bck1000.png)\" id=\"item.MS-5.5.4\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1 xhtCellNoWrap\"><img src=\"tbl_spacer.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"tbl_vline.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"tbl_blank.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"tbl_vjoin_end.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"icon-q-coding.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: white; background-color: inherit\" title=\"coding\" class=\"hierarchy\"/> <span style=\"position: absolute; width: 1px; height: 1px; padding: 0; margin: -1px; overflow: hidden; clip: rect(0, 0, 0, 0); white-space: nowrap; border: 0\" class=\"sr-only\">AHIP-DEMOGRAPHIC-QUESTIONNAIRE / MS / MS-5.5 / </span>MS-5.5.4</td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1\">Do you live with, or have you ever lived with, someone who is currently or has ever served in the armed forces of a country other than the United States? (i.e., parent, guardian, spouse, partner, child, sibling etc.) (Select one)</td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1\">0..1</td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1\"><a href=\"https://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-item-type.html#item-type-choice\">choice</a></td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1\">Value Set: <a href=\"ValueSet-ahip-yes-no-dont-know-no-response.html\">AHIP Yes, No, Don't Know, or No Response</a></td></tr>#xD;\n<tr class=\"xhtRowBorder1 xhtRowOdd\"><td style=\"background-image: url(tbl_bck01.png)\" id=\"item.SAOC\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1 xhtCellNoWrap\"><img src=\"tbl_spacer.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"tbl_vjoin_end.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"icon-q-group.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: #F7F7F7; background-color: inherit\" title=\"group\" class=\"hierarchy\"/> <span style=\"position: absolute; width: 1px; height: 1px; padding: 0; margin: -1px; overflow: hidden; clip: rect(0, 0, 0, 0); white-space: nowrap; border: 0\" class=\"sr-only\">AHIP-DEMOGRAPHIC-QUESTIONNAIRE / </span>SAOC</td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1\">Spirituality and Other Considerations Section</td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1\">0..1</td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1\"><a href=\"https://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-item-type.html#item-type-group\">group</a></td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1\"/></tr>#xD;\n<tr class=\"xhtRowBorder1 xhtRowEven\"><td style=\"background-image: url(tbl_bck010.png)\" id=\"item.SAOC-6.1\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1 xhtCellNoWrap\"><img src=\"tbl_spacer.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"tbl_blank.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"tbl_vjoin.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"icon-q-coding.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: white; background-color: inherit\" title=\"coding\" class=\"hierarchy\"/> <span style=\"position: absolute; width: 1px; height: 1px; padding: 0; margin: -1px; overflow: hidden; clip: rect(0, 0, 0, 0); white-space: nowrap; border: 0\" class=\"sr-only\">AHIP-DEMOGRAPHIC-QUESTIONNAIRE / SAOC / </span>SAOC-6.1</td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1\">Which of the following would you like us to know about you before we provide care? Select all that apply.</td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1\">0..*</td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1\"><a href=\"https://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-item-type.html#item-type-open-choice\">open-choice</a></td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1\">Value Set: <a href=\"ValueSet-ahip-care-consideration.html\">AHIP Care Consideration Value Set</a></td></tr>#xD;\n<tr class=\"xhtRowBorder1 xhtRowOdd\"><td style=\"background-image: url(tbl_bck010.png)\" id=\"item.SAOC-6.2\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1 xhtCellNoWrap\"><img src=\"tbl_spacer.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"tbl_blank.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"tbl_vjoin.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"icon-q-coding.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: #F7F7F7; background-color: inherit\" title=\"coding\" class=\"hierarchy\"/> <span style=\"position: absolute; width: 1px; height: 1px; padding: 0; margin: -1px; overflow: hidden; clip: rect(0, 0, 0, 0); white-space: nowrap; border: 0\" class=\"sr-only\">AHIP-DEMOGRAPHIC-QUESTIONNAIRE / SAOC / </span>SAOC-6.2</td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1\">What is your current religion, spirituality, or belief system, if any? ​Check all that apply.</td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1\">0..*</td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1\"><a href=\"https://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-item-type.html#item-type-open-choice\">open-choice</a></td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1\">Value Set: <a href=\"ValueSet-ahip-religion-spirituality.html\">AHIP Religion/Spirituality Value Set</a></td></tr>#xD;\n<tr class=\"xhtRowBorder1 xhtRowEven\"><td style=\"background-image: url(tbl_bck010.png)\" id=\"item.SAOC-6.2.1\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1 xhtCellNoWrap\"><img src=\"tbl_spacer.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"tbl_blank.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"tbl_vjoin.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"icon-q-coding.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: white; background-color: inherit\" title=\"coding\" class=\"hierarchy\"/> <span style=\"position: absolute; width: 1px; height: 1px; padding: 0; margin: -1px; overflow: hidden; clip: rect(0, 0, 0, 0); white-space: nowrap; border: 0\" class=\"sr-only\">AHIP-DEMOGRAPHIC-QUESTIONNAIRE / SAOC / </span>SAOC-6.2.1</td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1\">Which form of Christianity do you practice?</td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1\">0..*</td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1\"><a href=\"https://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-item-type.html#item-type-open-choice\">open-choice</a></td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1\">Enable When: <span><a href=\"#item.SAOC-6.2\">SAOC-6.2</a> = Christian (AHIP Demo Temporary Codes#CHRI)</span><br/>Value Set: <a href=\"ValueSet-ahip-religion-christian-detail.html\">AHIP Christian Religion Detail Value Set</a></td></tr>#xD;\n<tr class=\"xhtRowBorder1 xhtRowOdd\"><td style=\"background-image: url(tbl_bck010.png)\" id=\"item.SAOC-6.2.2\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1 xhtCellNoWrap\"><img src=\"tbl_spacer.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"tbl_blank.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"tbl_vjoin.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"icon-q-coding.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: #F7F7F7; background-color: inherit\" title=\"coding\" class=\"hierarchy\"/> <span style=\"position: absolute; width: 1px; height: 1px; padding: 0; margin: -1px; overflow: hidden; clip: rect(0, 0, 0, 0); white-space: nowrap; border: 0\" class=\"sr-only\">AHIP-DEMOGRAPHIC-QUESTIONNAIRE / SAOC / </span>SAOC-6.2.2</td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1\">Which form of Judaism do you practice?</td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1\">0..*</td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1\"><a href=\"https://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-item-type.html#item-type-open-choice\">open-choice</a></td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1\">Enable When: <span><a href=\"#item.SAOC-6.2\">SAOC-6.2</a> = Judaism (Religious Affiliation#1026)</span><br/>Value Set: <a href=\"ValueSet-ahip-religion-jewish-detail.html\">AHIP Jewish Religion Detail Value Set</a></td></tr>#xD;\n<tr class=\"xhtRowBorder1 xhtRowEven\"><td style=\"background-image: url(tbl_bck010.png)\" id=\"item.SAOC-6.3\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1 xhtCellNoWrap\"><img src=\"tbl_spacer.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"tbl_blank.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"tbl_vjoin.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"icon-q-string.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: white; background-color: inherit\" title=\"string\" class=\"hierarchy\"/> <span style=\"position: absolute; width: 1px; height: 1px; padding: 0; margin: -1px; overflow: hidden; clip: rect(0, 0, 0, 0); white-space: nowrap; border: 0\" class=\"sr-only\">AHIP-DEMOGRAPHIC-QUESTIONNAIRE / SAOC / </span>SAOC-6.3</td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1\">Optional: If you would like to share your specific religious denomination, sect, or spiritual group with us, please write it here:</td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1\">0..*</td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1\"><a href=\"https://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-item-type.html#item-type-string\">string</a></td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1\"/></tr>#xD;\n<tr class=\"xhtRowBorder1 xhtRowOdd\"><td style=\"background-image: url(tbl_bck000.png)\" id=\"item.SAOC-6.4\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1 xhtCellNoWrap\"><img src=\"tbl_spacer.png\" alt=\"\